  "productModerationTitle": "Product moderation",
  "productModerationSubtitle": "Review images that need human approval",
  "termsAccountTitle": "1. Accounts and security",
  "termsAccountBody": "You may browse listings as a guest. An account and sign-in are required for account features and for selling or buying. Provide accurate information and keep your password and verification codes confidential. Never share a one-time password (OTP). Phone verification may be required before certain selling or purchase steps.",
  "termsListingsTitle": "2. Products and listings",
  "termsListingsBody": "Listed products must be lawful and permitted. The person creating a listing must provide accurate photos, description, price and condition, and clearly disclose material defects. Stolen, counterfeit or prohibited goods, misleading listings and images that do not represent the product are not allowed.",
  "termsSellerTitle": "3. Seller responsibilities",
  "termsSellerBody": "The seller is responsible for having the right to offer the product and for the accuracy of its details, photos, price and condition. The seller must answer buyer questions clearly and honor the product and delivery arrangements agreed with the buyer.",
  "termsBuyerTitle": "4. Buyer responsibilities",
  "termsBuyerBody": "Review the listing, price and photos, and ask for clarification before agreeing. Confirm the product details, delivery method and cost before confirming an order. Never share passwords or verification codes.",
  "termsDeliveryTitle": "5. Delivery and shipping",
  "termsDeliveryBody": "Delivery options depend on the areas covered by Kenza Hub services. The buyer and seller may also arrange delivery between themselves. Confirm the delivery method, cost, timing and responsibilities before making an agreement. A listing being visible does not mean shipping is available in every area.",
  "termsPaymentTitle": "6. Prices and payments",
  "termsPaymentBody": "The seller sets the product price. Any additional fees or costs should be shown through a clear in-app flow when that feature is enabled. Do not assume electronic payment, financial protection or refunds are available unless the app explicitly confirms the service at the time of the transaction. Never ask another user for card details or passwords.",
  "termsPrivacyTitle": "7. Privacy and data",
  "termsPrivacyBody": "Account, listing, messaging and order data are handled under the Privacy Policy. Do not publish your phone number, address or private documents in public listings or images. Do not attempt to access another user's data or use it for an unauthorized purpose.",
  "termsConductTitle": "8. Conduct and prohibited content",
  "termsConductBody": "Fraud, impersonation, harassment, threats, listing or rating manipulation, unlawful content, attempts to break into the app, and disruption of its services are prohibited. Listings may be removed and accounts may be restricted following platform review.",
  "termsPlatformTitle": "9. Kenza Hub's role and service limits",
  "termsPlatformBody": "Kenza Hub is an online platform for listing and discovering products and facilitating communication between users. It does not own products listed by users. Sellers remain responsible for their products, and buyers remain responsible for reviewing listings and reaching agreement with sellers. The platform is not a party to private arrangements made outside its official flows.",
  "termsChangesTitle": "10. Changes to these terms",
  "termsChangesBody": "These terms may change as the app and its services develop. The in-app text will be updated when material changes are made. Continued use after an update is subject to the revised terms, in accordance with applicable legal requirements.",
  "privacyIntro": "This policy explains the types of information Kenza Hub may handle, why it is used, and the basic controls for access and retention. It is an operational draft based on the current service design and requires legal review before public launch.",
  "privacyDataTitle": "1. Information we handle",
  "privacyDataBody": "This may include account information such as name, email address, phone number and profile details; listing information such as product photos, descriptions and prices; message content; and order information needed for communication and delivery. The app may also process technical information needed to operate and protect the service.",
  "privacyUseTitle": "2. How information is used",
  "privacyUseBody": "Information is used to create and verify accounts, operate browsing, selling and buying, display listings, facilitate communication, manage orders, address disputes when necessary, improve service security and prevent misuse.",
  "privacyPhoneTitle": "3. Phone number and verification",
  "privacyPhoneBody": "Your phone number is used as an account-ownership verification factor. A one-time password (OTP) may be sent when verification is required. Do not share verification codes with anyone or send them to another user.",
  "privacyVisibilityTitle": "4. Who can access your information",
  "privacyVisibilityBody": "Private account information is not publicly displayed. Store employees are not intended to access buyers' private data. An employee may access conversations within their assigned permissions; transaction contact and delivery details are made available only when genuinely needed to fulfill an order. Administrators may access information necessary to investigate a report, dispute or security incident.",
  "privacyMessagesTitle": "5. Messages",
  "privacyMessagesBody": "Messages support communication between platform users. Under the approved design, neither participant can delete the conversation history from the other participant's account. Administrators may review a conversation when needed to investigate a dispute, misuse or report.",
  "privacyOrderDataTitle": "6. Order contact and delivery information",
  "privacyOrderDataBody": "Additional contact or delivery details may be requested when needed to fulfill an order. These details are not publicly displayed to other users and are used for the transaction, delivery and related issue resolution.",
  "privacyRetentionTitle": "7. Retention and deletion",
  "privacyRetentionBody": "Under the approved operational policy, additional contact and delivery information associated with an order is retained for up to 60 days and then deleted under the applicable deletion process, unless a legitimate need requires retention because of a dispute or legal or security obligation. This period does not mean that all account data or messages are deleted after 60 days.",
  "privacySecurityTitle": "8. Data protection",
  "privacySecurityBody": "Access controls and permissions are intended to limit unnecessary access and help protect accounts and the service. No internet service can guarantee absolute security. Keep your login details and verification codes confidential and report unusual activity.",
